+// in Chromium or Firefox).  Without waitAsync, Emscripten notifies by
+// postMessage, as for browsers that lack it; no measurable cost elsewhere.
+// Top level, so that it runs in the runtime's worker and in every pthread
+// before Emscripten checks for waitAsync.
